OL,3,GNEWSADinner lady reflects on 48 years
OL,4,Aof meals and memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dinner lady who has worked at the
OL,7,Fsame school for almost 50 years said
OL,8,Fthe job gives her a purpose to get out
OL,9,Fof bed in the morning.
OL,11,FMarlene Becks turned 80 on Friday and
OL,12,Fhas been at South End Infant School,
OL,13,FRushden, Northamptonshire for 48 years.
OL,15,FShe told the BBC "I love the children -
OL,16,FI lost my husband 21 years ago and it
OL,17,Fstill hurts. I carried on with the
OL,18,Fschool and it helps me and gives me a
OL,19,Fpurpose to get up in the morning."
