OL,3,GNEWSADinner lady reflects on 48 years
OL,4,Aof meals and memories
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecks, whose official title is a
OL,7,Flunchtime supervisor, said "The best
OL,8,Fthing about being a dinner lady is the
OL,9,Fchildren. I just love the job."
